    In this authoritative, data-driven guide, the <strong>VoltSavings Research Team</strong> breaks down real-world telemetry from across the United States. We examine the exact kilowatt-hour (kWh) mathematical formulas, compare residential utility rates across major states (from low-cost Texas to high-rate California), analyze popular models like the <strong>Tesla Model Y</strong> and <strong>Ford F-150 Lightning</strong>, and quantify the impact of the <strong>$7,500 Federal Clean Vehicle Tax Credit</strong>.
  </p>

