      <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mb-3 leading-relaxed">
        High-voltage direct current (400V to 800V) pushing 50 kW to 350 kW. Recharges a battery from <strong>10% to 80% in 18 to 30 minutes</strong>.
      </p>
