      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed">
    <strong>The Home Level 2 Installation Investment:</strong> A dedicated Level 2 home charging station (such as a Tesla Wall Connector, ChargePoint Home Flex, or Emporia EV Charger) typically retails between $400 and $650. Professional licensed electrician installation adds $400 to $1,000 depending on your home panel capacity. Under the federal <strong>Alternative Fuel Vehicle Refueling Property Credit (IRC Section 30C)</strong>, eligible homeowners in non-urban or low-income census tracts can claim a <strong>30% tax credit up to $1,000</strong> on hardware and installation costs.
  </p>

